{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:13eb6b3c89529f9cd3eb1fda81bb7c51f8b421a70e3e150cb8c1f0cbb039c8e1",
      "text": "A slump?!?!?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:dcd70a8318e1622ec0d7f2dd2cfcdec5e8894868d3c86193de6444c5dc388e46",
      "text": "N-no, it's not that big a deal.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "12": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:dfc6da3f45f4b9ff2c306716a4e670005ef5f61c2ac1577df30db988ab64fde7",
      "text": "It's just that the new song...\nsomehow doesn't feel right...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "17": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:efdc0931c390e50f549f35e40cce32245d34b0317963c0016d0b16055304a830",
      "text": "New song— Oh, the one Mr. Takamori\nmentioned. The one to lighten\neveryone's anxiety...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "21": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c56487bb00e1596cea7034d9c8916627168d6f8cd6e2ebe43ab1ce96594cfa84",
      "text": "...Until now, I could just turn\nwhatever I felt into sound.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "25": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:53c9bf2467fe6d759e85eca3a6989542527c8dbcc06858b0d86bde60735607fb",
      "text": "But this time that's not enough. I\nhave to deliver it from me to\neveryone—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "29": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b4cec8be990f5daec9c27c848d2f72358a0ed5a5b30954542616b9001a17ee17",
      "text": "This time, I want to be the one who\nhelps...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "34": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8ff6966f77c99e5a8824370e0465feaa77b263d3a7cbfae91741891c4e4ececc",
      "text": "Try not to dwell on it too much—\n...Well, that's hard, huh.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "39": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:67914ad6bd70b9fcc3e3da5868448729419df293a850ad590356ea4e98c9a028",
      "text": "...Yes... I keep losing track more\nand more...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "45": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c925a97e84b2fd8c14190ddbaccea73b05d4cff4dae38b2f137d18304b855289",
      "text": "This is a grave situation...! A\nloss for the world. We must take\nimmediate action.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "49": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a6e7d0e5707f40d1fa26394f0a4d63111bfa4d1caafe72e597a39780d5370817",
      "text": "Is there a good way?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "53": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:30dfbdfac6fd6c852340ae15cb61c7fa42315396388091eb7f3b628058fd08a2",
      "text": "Yes. It is, in short—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "60": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b8a8294cee5e5be7e1e8ed004482f36b5890b2089d4c6bf41a471adce51141d6",
      "text": "Play as hard as you can and blow\noff steam!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "64": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ed3b3ccff3ff84b9edd2412c8e33762ab73e644abc49b0cd4dffe1b6fe949b91",
      "text": "Huh. Huh???",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "69": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9ea4c4d0010b69da3238ab4ee483389b328cc93e2bb54a350a8eaa24d6b2ba90",
      "text": "Sounds good. Sumina, you've been\nhelping with reconstruction and\nwriting songs in between, right?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "74": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9ebd3dc5bade45adde3aeb8ef7fd2d8cd511c52de7610ca1a16a796b9bdcb780",
      "text": "You gotta take a breather. We went\nto Paradise Isle too! Yeah, we're\ngoing again this year!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "79": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:891b3ea27854422cb29c9f9b05d14b6e3c8f1881ce3fee2c06103c163b8dcdc4",
      "text": "Let's play a lot.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "85": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d4556da9c72be55a6e628e68bc7e2390382ea34e263e43cd94d3594f6ec2ebcb",
      "text": "...Yes!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "90": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b7de057ecd65efd45b1885028ed89fd215ea1ade517d5f99d7f2b8139f12660e",
      "text": "That game's difficulty is insane,\nright?! Even with psychic powers\nit's impossible???",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "94": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fee3bc3fbeba72e450327e2ecfcffbba884e5b45dc6434206a933de4ced4ac5d",
      "text": "Told you. It's for Bionics players,\nso it's brutal.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "98": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a11c6356357ce1f656bb70e7a65c65b7aa8ea62fd032e99be3e9cdb6634f9413",
      "text": "What are you doing? Taking photos\non a tablet?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "103": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9959dd0f6b81622d2c3438f44cf7feab06d0ed53cfc3fdd30f980a79a4d161cb",
      "text": "No, I recorded sounds around the\ncity. Qualia City has lots of\ninteresting sounds.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "108": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7af9c24a06905a39097980187d44505650417ecaace651cfe85a2a89b33fb0b6",
      "text": "Huh? What do you mean??",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "112": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f4bd2562bcefbd318ac5428a37a7cc1f18eb42615f7cfe09761638cfaa903e0d",
      "text": "I like collecting all kinds of\nsounds. It's my hobby.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "114": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a3b7aea35dd214c61bc8ba36da9973cda293cef787a0c307e16f5eb522a40461",
      "text": "Footsteps, animal calls, noises\nfrom shops at work.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "118": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e7c4d0bdd61b35b05d0bd59ab9abab0e9f8f16567055519fe7837825133b9b3e",
      "text": "O-oh...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "122": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:29d9b7f65fc4cc354363ec522581a63fc9828573c8e91c48bae6da84310d9182",
      "text": "You recorded all sorts of sounds\nwhen I invited you to the House of\nSextan Villa last summer, too.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "127": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9a5d241e3e4e0da1c41fa81863bf51fa7ee4178169950472dee176865533166b",
      "text": "Yes. Hardly anyone does it, but\nit's fun. And I can make songs with\nthem.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "132": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:39d009087a998a74f9c011673320e0564b314c6b59033f8f462e86030503420e",
      "text": "Oh! I've seen this in videos! Wait,\nbut isn't this amazing? It's a real\nsong!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "136": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:394cf2ec3b47a9ca3c1fea5694b5e1ef9d750973bba4bd81d866ade7456a6d45",
      "text": "Making songs from sounds collected\non your travels brings back the\nmemories. I recommend it...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "141": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b1c2d8c1b65770bd28490ea2c90f27cb4f8b702885f11b136d71e2c585e84b1c",
      "text": "That's wonderful. I want to try,\nbut—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "146": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:74a6e8e51c558d73577bf3b008ed9bd1b919e6e70564ddc1a3430461124899d1",
      "text": "It looks very difficult.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "150": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9a12b611625d5d8a011ffc788108c63d56b8a97758fa89bc14947c9b4ce322b5",
      "text": "U-um...! Then, I'll turn it into a\nsong for you later...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "155": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:385b3ba3e45432d78debcc022415145eb84d1be85574dc6d26a1ad7b1de6bb92",
      "text": "Hehe. Thank you, Hibiki. It will be\na lovely memory of graduation.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "159": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ea4a472092d086512d261e0bff64074cc64d2c6921864650da285baf5ad8130d",
      "text": "Oh... Right. You're graduating,\nLuciada.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "164": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0cf71999d8feced2ddc57f8cc9dd3777457e5476bf051432885a1ebe4d051ef5",
      "text": "After graduation, will you become a\nteacher at the Magic Academy?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "169": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:01510289a5d9713ca115a7a1a1add782951d1dd2b95134494809aa70b0990928",
      "text": "No. I have family matters. After\ngraduation, I will return to the\nFarlands.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "174": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f326cf643be1f90fb56e918f312cb50bca19a0a8c162dce1fc2a83309414453a",
      "text": "...I see.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "178": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:531e3020e6844649e9cdcce4085e8c86853d486ad88314883dfa21d054f6d142",
      "text": "It's sad that I won't be able to\nvisit Starview Village so easily\nlike now... but it can't be helped.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "182": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5510279ba542a28bf9b1e1705e8e950f3a50173e83231bb7dd160373d107717e",
      "text": "Oh, but I will definitely come to\nthe concert of you and Dia! Rest\nassured!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "186": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c12468a39875dbce00ef9276ef31eae065403ff8496c8af260c3093f92b95bc8",
      "text": "I'm not worried about that at all.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "191": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ef8e3bfd6ddc5c05632e8ee317ad83a274a99fc4b9dc4d5e565e068bee20db6a",
      "text": "Hey, why not?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "198": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0ad8d521cb6f25f44a0d659eca6053d1cd490dc0ad3104fedb636f5700677bce",
      "text": "...Haah...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "200": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4ce00ed3f6ca28f2812937c9a0461524731c8c0c268a183829946647955a19d4",
      "text": "It's no good... I could write so\nsmoothly this afternoon...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "202": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c97928ae2b92f36f73cfd55278f867471fc842ceba2461094a3eb854c1ff39cf",
      "text": "To the people of Shibuya... To the\nseniors who invited me out to\nunwind...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "206": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:57f6d4461577b9c17fd9c6ddc0dba02a2baa52f8a2677788026d5ee51341aab5",
      "text": "...I can't live up to anyone's\nhopes...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "209": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4105ffa98b0bc6af26c86c7fbcd84af7ea10a90ef0a660c90784102c98b36204",
      "text": "Graduation, huh...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "211": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:be44dd36703e29d04a95d4b68e28cebe658dd5554a57a569c070f51ea21d9fc1",
      "text": "......Well...... With psychic\npowers, it's quick......",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "214": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ba6b5e2482e01d388f537667c7e39e279462307b1edd2cbf94fcea99f4797698",
      "text": "...They helped me so much...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "220": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5ca8f1f65959bb2c1fc4c84bc3ada062a1f6ed0ef0070ac9560c1270385b78e5",
      "text": "I see... So that's what it meant...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "224": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f762dd73f5dc39d800514d8cbe9e9c1823ee92d3a563518f53def9699d2d3bf4",
      "text": "I am—!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "230": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7cee5faf42d3ce759702f221473a0c0f75f350bbe3c4099a660fa61fe621edb9",
      "text": "Oh my! Then the new song you were\nstruggling with is finished...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "235": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f35d635833221543e9fc1ed0332cab8d223b9071b164c739a9dab4a0bde5ed5e",
      "text": "Yes, thanks to you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "239": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ff216e90d77b31f5730e9d48b4aabf7d745444ff1511c46314e6633fddc30def",
      "text": "Is this the new song?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "244": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a42d248b8489cfc37f7222fb0b4fd950229d2df2f55e55d89515781c0b3aaade",
      "text": "N-no. That's, um...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "246": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7ebab5a72202a162171334be57a16b444088cffdcfd48787ab73a6b9394c3463",
      "text": "......It's a song I made for you,\nLuciada.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "249": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5f21da3411ef381ae44a8a98aec55437ed6e838c25b8cd1ab6fbefac64c9c264",
      "text": "You've helped me so much, and I\nhaven't repaid you at all... So,\num, as a thank-you, kind of...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "252": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b8494871f4dbecd9445dbdb0495f097f060716cc542bc5383021d4867c60866f",
      "text": "...Luciada, the people of Shibuya,\nso many people have helped me...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "255": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4ea21ce2aa6d64d1f42020720c92acb04433389826d050cd5d5503ea4aed4bba",
      "text": "When I thought about repaying them,\nthe song came out like my worries\nhad never existed.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "258": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c8368a6769e3d25f8f3c242b71e8f48e1950f152b84e01ec9a9adfc4d64bb057",
      "text": "I realized I don't want to\nencourage. I want to say thank you.\nSo...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "262": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499",
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "266": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2d0a44ac30db1052d7345906a428304669140366efb6a443e16216674166a811",
      "text": "Hehe, you're welcome. If I could\nhelp you, I'm glad.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "271": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0f624fd51efd7aec7acdb84d98db795f3693f1d44598da6dc80e706379509e86",
      "text": "Ah! Don't listen to that yet...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "275": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d9f965d84e87156bc0d9b91b815cc53a853c730f7ce83c14abba77dbd1c6d7dd",
      "text": "......It's embarrassing. ...Please\nlisten after you've returned to the\nFarlands.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "278": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3e6bd738e7a0c830c03c5190794510882ba3f3fb66c60be9eedd4e886bae720a",
      "text": "...Um. Please give that back. Just\nin case, I'll hand it over again\nright before you leave.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "287": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e05a0cdd246bd4690dcf7195c24af4fdc41f4fd27ade4dcab6cc663e74848ac2",
      "text": "Hey, wait!?!? Heeey!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
